# Topos — .gitignore
# Standard C# / .NET ignores (anticipating M0 code) + OS noise

## Build results
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
artifacts/

## .NET / NuGet
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/
**/Properties/launchSettings.json

# NuGet packages
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/

# NuGet package output (local build artifact; never commit)
nupkgs/

## Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code (keep editor-agnostic; individuals can override)
.vs/
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user

## OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Personal local MCP wiring (absolute paths + other-repo references; not portable).
## Public template lives at samples/Topos.Samples.McpAgent/.mcp.json.example.
/.mcp.json
.agents/mcp_config.json

## BenchmarkDotNet results (anticipated for M0 measured-benchmark gate)
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
*-report.html
*-report.csv
*-report-grep.md
